<title>FRANCE: BOF's Trichet says dollar probably &quot;too weak&quot;.</title>
<headline>BOF's Trichet says dollar probably &quot;too weak&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of France Governor Jean-Claude Trichet said on Saturday that the dollar was probably &quot;too weak&quot; against European currencies.</p>
<p>&quot;We now have probably a dollar level compared to European currencies that is too weak,&quot; Trichet told a seminar on European monetary union.</p>
</text>
